    "detailed_description": "It is a popular elimination game with its dazzling color matching and extremely smooth visual expression. <br />\r\nThe game follows the classic star elimination gameplay, where players only need to tap the screen and select stars connected in the same color to eliminate them, experiencing the exhilarating chain reaction. The game screen adopts a design style of flowing light and colors, with each star shining with a unique light. Each elimination will trigger brilliant light and shadow effects, making it pleasing to the eye.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a relaxed and enjoyable gaming atmosphere, the pleasant sound effects are closely coordinated with each elimination action, providing players with an immersive sensory experience. The game emphasizes fluency and a sense of operation. Whether it's the sliding of stars or the elimination of animations, they are incredibly smooth, allowing players to enjoy the pleasure of elimination and challenge higher score records.",
